Description: OCI container runtime monitor (built from source)
 Conmon is a small program that sits between a container runtime (crun, runc)
 and podman, supervising the container process and handling logging, TTY
 handling and exit status reporting.
 .
 Built from the upstream v2.2.1 tag. jammy ships conmon 2.0.25, which
 is four years older than podman 4.9.x and below the version podman 4.x expects,
 so this package supersedes it. The podman package depends on
 `conmon (>= 2.1.0)`, which apt cannot satisfy from jammy -- so this repository's
 build is always the one selected.
Homepage: https://github.com/containers/conmon

